  "prompt": "prompts/medicine_committee_terra_round1_v1.md",
  "preferred_configuration": {
    "prize_parts": [
      {
        "ballot_id": "B004",
        "laureates": [
          "Douglas R. Lowy",
          "Ian H. Frazer",
          "John T. Schiller"
        ],
        "citation": "for virus-like particle vaccines that prevent HPV infection and related cancers"
      }
    ]
  },
  "alternatives": [
    "B010",
    "B027"
  ],
  "statement": {
    "case_for": "B004 remains the strongest configuration: it links a well-defined virological principle to durable, highly effective prevention of infection and major cancers. The preventive medical consequence is extraordinary and mature, while Lowy, Frazer, and Schiller provide a coherent three-person account of the central VLP and vaccine advance.",
    "case_against": "The achievement rests on a broader chain including papillomavirus biology, VLP work, clinical development, and implementation, so the precise boundary of the credited discovery and allocation within that chain require careful historical scrutiny. Earlier recognition of HPV causation also reinforces the need to define the vaccine achievement as distinct.",
    "responses": [
      {
        "member_id": "wahren-herlenius-marie",
        "point": "She emphasizes that GLP-1 physiology has broad, durable therapeutic consequences, while noting that HPV vaccination must be distinguished from previously recognized HPV-cancer causation.",
        "response": "The GLP-1 achievement is an exceptionally strong alternative, but its attribution spans hormone discovery, receptor and physiological work, and pharmaceutical development. For B004, the VLP-vaccine principle and its preventive result form a more delimited discovery-to-medicine narrative; the distinction from causation is a reason for precise citation wording, not a reason to discount the separate advance."
      },
      {
        "member_id": "svenningsson-per",
        "point": "He argues that integrins are a deeply mature and foundational framework for adhesion, signaling, immunity, and development.",
        "response": "I agree that B001 is fundamental and deserving of serious consideration. Its breadth, however, also makes the boundary of the specific discovery and the three-person allocation more difficult. B004 combines comparable maturity with a more sharply identifiable intervention and direct, large-scale prevention of cancer."
      },
      {
        "member_id": "sandberg-rickard",
        "point": "He places GLP-1 first because the biology and clinical benefit have transformed treatment of diabetes and obesity, while acknowledging distributed credit beyond the proposed trio.",
        "response": "That therapeutic transformation is compelling. The distributed discovery-to-drug-development pathway is nevertheless a material attribution reservation, whereas the proposed B004 trio is more tightly connected to the nominated VLP vaccine achievement."
      }
    ],
    "uncertainties": [
      "Whether the credited trio most completely captures the foundational VLP work within the three-person limit.",
      "How narrowly the citation should distinguish prophylactic vaccination from the previously recognized discovery of HPV causation."
    ],
    "conflict_note": "None apparent from the supplied profile."
  }
}
